<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting> a pk:Claim ;
    rdfs:label "Graner & Glazier (1992) / Glazier & Graner (1993) extended large-Q Cellular Potts Model cell sorting (Hydra attenuata (endoderm/ectoderm reaggregates) & Gallus gallus embryonic cell spheroids)",
        "Graner & Glazier (1992) / Glazier & Graner (1993) extended large-Q Cellular Potts Model cell sorting faithfully reproduces Hydra attenuata (endoderm/ectoderm reaggregates) & Gallus gallus embryonic cell spheroids morphology" ;
    dct:conformsTo <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/math-law/graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting-3> ;
    dct:description "The simulation script(s) 1992-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting.py implement the cited source model as published and produce forms that match real Hydra attenuata (endoderm/ectoderm reaggregates) & Gallus gallus embryonic cell spheroids specimens and the source authors' figures. A belief under audit, not a fact: its credibility is the weight of evidence (MorphoEval 0.1.0 overall 91.2/100, audit 2026-10-19-cellular-potts-cell-sorting-audit-v2) and the assessments." ;
    dct:subject <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/b9976f8/1992-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting.py> ;
    schema:about "Hydra attenuata (endoderm/ectoderm reaggregates) & Gallus gallus embryonic cell spheroids" ;
    schema:additionalProperty "does_not_claim: Does not model subcellular cytoskeletal actin-myosin turnover or active chemotactic signaling.",
        "reconstructed_in_script: 2D extended large-Q Cellular Potts Model across all 4 canonical phase regimes plus T=0 pinning and equal-adhesion negative controls, a 7-point continuous J_LD sweep, and a 6-point fluctuation temperature sweep.",
        "reconstructed_in_script: Computer-vision segmentation of confocal fluorescence embryonic cell aggregate (`embryonic_cell_aggregate_specimen.jpg`) comparing empirical GFP/RFP radial occupancy against CPM core-shell profiles (r = 0.9612, RMSE = 0.154).",
        "reported_in_source: Glazier & Graner (1993) PRE Table I & Section III.B: classification of 4 equilibrium phase regimes (complete engulfment, partial sorting lens, checkerboard mixing, and cell dissociation) and fluctuation temperature controls (T=0 lattice pinning arrest vs optimal thermal sorting vs high-T thermal melting).",
        "reported_in_source: Graner & Glazier (1992) PRL Eqs. 1-3 & Fig. 3: extended large-Q Cellular Potts Model Hamiltonian with bond-energy surface tensions gamma_LD = J_LD - (J_LL + J_DD)/2 and gamma_alphaM = J_alphaM - J_alphaalpha/2 driving logarithmic heterotypic boundary decay L_het(t) ~ A - B ln(t).",
        "transfer_boundary: 2D lattice Cellular Potts representation of 3D multicellular spheroid cross-sections." ;
    pk:context "script(s): https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/b9976f8/1992-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting.py; output: docs/media/cellular_potts_cell_sorting_comparison.png; organism: Hydra attenuata (endoderm/ectoderm reaggregates) & Gallus gallus embryonic cell spheroids; checkpoint commit: https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/commit/b9976f8; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1; spec_fingerprint: 7cdd3f38f0e6192e614f25f3f47d81cb4d09870705b0e0dca1d1d4dbca9f4cc0; artifact_sha256: 94cf7dc29ecf10cff051dd93ee95b5ee2557e2bab5b85948a912a902322f4ffe; supersedes_audit_id: 2026-10-19-cellular-potts-cell-sorting-audit; claim_boundary: [reported_in_source: Graner & Glazier (1992) PRL Eqs. 1-3 & Fig. 3: extended large-Q Cellular Potts Model Hamiltonian with bond-energy surface tensions gamma_LD = J_LD - (J_LL + J_DD)/2 and gamma_alphaM = J_alphaM - J_alphaalpha/2 driving logarithmic heterotypic boundary decay L_het(t) ~ A - B ln(t). | Glazier & Graner (1993) PRE Table I & Section III.B: classification of 4 equilibrium phase regimes (complete engulfment, partial sorting lens, checkerboard mixing, and cell dissociation) and fluctuation temperature controls (T=0 lattice pinning arrest vs optimal thermal sorting vs high-T thermal melting).; reconstructed_in_script: 2D extended large-Q Cellular Potts Model across all 4 canonical phase regimes plus T=0 pinning and equal-adhesion negative controls, a 7-point continuous J_LD sweep, and a 6-point fluctuation temperature sweep. | Computer-vision segmentation of confocal fluorescence embryonic cell aggregate (`embryonic_cell_aggregate_specimen.jpg`) comparing empirical GFP/RFP radial occupancy against CPM core-shell profiles (r = 0.9612, RMSE = 0.154).; transfer_boundary: 2D lattice Cellular Potts representation of 3D multicellular spheroid cross-sections.; does_not_claim: Does not model subcellular cytoskeletal actin-myosin turnover or active chemotactic signaling.]" ;
    pk:derivedFromPaper <https://doi.org/10.1038/newbio239098a0>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevE.47.2128>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1103/PhysRevLett.69.2013>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1126/science.141.3579.401>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1242/dev.122.5.1611> ;
    pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting-code-traceability>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting-model-fidelity>,
