<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Graner & Glazier (1992) / Glazier & Graner (1993) extended large-Q Cellular Potts Model cell sorting — Model fidelity to source: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Faithfully implements Graner & Glazier's (1992) PRL Eqs. (1)-(3) surface tension laws (`compute_cpm_tensions`, L97-144) and 2D extended large-Q Cellular Potts Hamiltonian (`simulate_cpm_regime`, L249-456) across all 4 canonical phase regimes plus 2 negative/pinning controls: complete engulfment (`0 < gamma_LD = 3 < 6`, Δr = +0.3317, L_LD/L = 0.1705), partial sorting lens (`gamma_LD = 8 > 6`, L_LD/L = 0.138), checkerboard mixing (`gamma_LD = -10 < 0`, L_LD/L = 0.720), cell dissociation (`gamma_LM = -5 < 0`), zero-temperature pinning arrest (`T = 0`, |Δr| = 0.0155, L_LD/L = 0.424), and equal-adhesion control (`gamma_LD = 0`, |Δr| = 0.0353). Backed by 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems (0 sorrys)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-graner-cellular-potts-cell-sorting-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Graner & Glazier (1992) / Glazier & Graner (1993) extended large-Q Cellular Potts Model cell sorting — Morphometric validation: 90/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Computes 8 quantitative morphometrics in `measure_morphoeval()` (L787-860), including normalized radial core-shell separation `Δr = +0.3317`, fractional heterotypic boundary length `L_LD/L_total = 0.1705` with logarithmic decay fit (`r = -0.9459, p < 1e-70`) and Graner & Glazier (1992) Fig. 3 checkpoint concordance (`r = 0.9724`), zero-temperature pinning arrest (`|Δr| = 0.0155`), equal-adhesion null separation (`|Δr| = 0.0353`), and 12-annulus radial profile correlation against the segmented confocal specimen (`r = 0.9612, RMSE = 0.154`)." ;
